1
00:00:00,850 --> 00:00:02,650
(Page:)I see.

2
00:00:02,650 --> 00:00:05,520
(Howard:)Well, it's good to know, when
I need you guys, I can always

3
00:00:05,520 --> 00:00:08,420
(Howard:)count on you to step up
and ruin everything.

4
00:00:10,990 --> 00:00:12,660
(Leonard:)I feel awful.

5
00:00:12,660 --> 00:00:13,560
(Raj:)Ah, me, too.

6
00:00:13,560 --> 00:00:14,590
(Leonard:)To tell you the truth,

7
00:00:14,590 --> 00:00:15,990
(Leonard:)I thought if anyone was going to

8
00:00:15,990 --> 00:00:17,530
(Leonard:)screw things up for Howard,
it'd be Sheldon.

9
00:00:17,530 --> 00:00:22,370
(Sheldon:)Well, your expectations
have been subverted.

10
00:00:22,370 --> 00:00:24,070
(Sheldon:)Aha.

11
00:00:32,370 --> 00:00:34,300
(Leonard:)What are you doing up?

12
00:00:34,300 --> 00:00:36,470
(Sheldon:)Sleep eludes me, Leonard.

13
00:00:36,470 --> 00:00:37,850
(Leonard:)Really?

14
00:00:37,860 --> 00:00:40,360
(Leonard:)Maybe sleep has met you before.

15
00:00:40,360 --> 00:00:41,910
(Sheldon:)Mockery?

16
00:00:41,910 --> 00:00:43,730
(Sheldon:)That's all you have to offer?

17
00:00:43,730 --> 00:00:45,050
(Leonard:)I'm sorry. Why can't you sleep?

18
00:00:45,050 --> 00:00:46,450
(Sheldon:)Who knows?

19
00:00:46,450 --> 00:00:48,850
(Sheldon:)I haven't watched
any scary movies recently.

20
00:00:48,850 --> 00:00:51,520
(Sheldon:)I'm no longer obsessing
over why the predicted mass

21
00:00:51,520 --> 00:00:53,490
(Sheldon:)of the quantum vacuum
has little effect

22
00:00:53,490 --> 00:00:55,520
(Sheldon:)on the expansion
of the universe.

23
00:00:55,520 --> 00:00:59,240
(Sheldon:)And it's been weeks since I took
that accidental sip of Red Bull.

